abstract: "Constructive Agda development of ordinal notations, extracted from echo-types: Brouwer ordinals, the Veblen hierarchy up to a defined Γ₀, and a Buchholz-style term order with machine-checked well-foundedness under --safe --without-K. Frozen hand-off record; order-type fidelity to ψ₀(Ω_ω) is open."
